id:                     E3377
title: 模拟命令生成器保留同一Python与调用记录的入口适配
trigger_tool: python|pytest
phase: testing
error_signature: MockCommand generated Python shebang command waits while same interpreter explicit execution succeeds
severity:               2
category:               portability, python, testing, shell
match_keywords: MockCommand, testpath, generated command, shebang, same interpreter, argv recording, shell exec, original pytest
root_cause: Testpath默认生成脚本直接以同一Python的shebang作为命令入口；目标中该路径等待，而同一解释器的二进制子进程和显式解释脚本可正常执行。入口路径的可执行性须独立验证，不能把原测试超时等同于整个Python提供者失效，或仅凭vfork标志推定根因。
affected_scope: 需保持命令式调用与记录语义的Python默认模拟命令生成器
verification_cmd: actual target pytest all original3 programs14 cases plus installed command stdout stderr exit and recorded argv
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: preserve-generated-command-contract-through-same-interpreter-exec
rec_description: 绑定官方commands.py与相同发布Python，分别比较裸命令、绝对脚本、显式解释器、关闭vfork和SDK对照；为实际HarmonyOS的默认生成内容采用系统Shell后exec同一sys.executable的单文件双语入口，用shlex.quote及原$0/$@保留解释器身份、参数和记录内容；自定义content与其他平台沿用原逻辑。全部原始测试与调用点不变，安装后再核对stdout/stderr、非零退出状态、单次记录和参数。
rec_command: original verify_original.py pytest tests and installed MockCommand.fixed_output nonzero-exit consumer
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: Keep original test call sites; adapt only default Harmony generator content; bind the actual interpreter and preserve script argv, recording and extra code.
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/E2026101615368-draft-A139.md
last_updated: 2026-10-16
